- agent_b_decision: |
    TASK-084 should be CANCELLED. Encoding share is 0.21% (size 25)
    and 0.11% (size 100) of total CPU — both well under the 5% / 10%
    trigger thresholds. Architecture analysis confirms: Go encoders
    are inlined binary.Endian.Put* calls with no heap allocs, no
    codec dispatch, no reflection. See docs/reports/M5/agent-a.md
    "TASK-084 decision input" section for the full pprof breakdown
    and reproduction recipe.
